  "title": "Envirocast® Wall System Achieves Two-Hour Fire-Rating Certification",
  "summary": "CXT® Inc., a subsidiary of L.B. Foster, officially achieved a two-hour fire-resistance rating for the 10.5” thick Envirocast wall panel system. Envirocast, a factory-cast panel system with integral concrete, insulation and metal studs, provides a rapidly erected solution for the exterior walls of residential and light commercial buildings.",
